# Harbor projects

## Gate

Use when the user authorized Harbor work and the turn needs **project**
inventory: list projects, pick a project for repos/artifacts, or audit
visibility/members at a high level. Skip bare "registry" talk without
Harbor. Load `harbor-safety` on every Harbor turn. Artifact/tag detail →
`harbor-artifacts`. Robot accounts → robot section in `harbor-safety` /
compound skills. Other OCI registry products are out of scope.

## Prefer live surface

No Harbor MCP was discovered in the live harness catalog. Prefer:

1. Harbor **REST API** with a base URL from operator config / env
2. Authenticated Harbor **UI** when API access is unavailable

If an MCP appears later, discover tools from the live map — do not invent
tool names. Never hardcode a host. Never invent project names/ids —
list/resolve this turn or use exact names the user pasted.

## Craft

| Need | Approach |
| --- | --- |
| List projects | API `/projects` (or UI Projects) |
| One project | Resolve by name/id from list; report visibility + repo count when present |
| Members / role summary | Read-only member list — no role widen without `harbor-safety` |
| Public / private toggle | Explicit verb via `harbor-safety` |

## Discover first

1. Resolve **base URL** from config/env — refuse guessing.
2. List projects before naming one for artifact or retention work.
3. Report **name + id + visibility** — never paste admin passwords or
   robot tokens.

## Procedure (read paths)

1. **Scope** — fleet list vs one named project. **Done when** clear.
2. **List / resolve** — evidence from API/UI this turn.
   **Done when** every project name you cite was listed or user-pasted.
3. **Report** — short table (see shape). **Done when** no secrets appear.

## Report shape

- **name** / **id**
- **visibility** — public / private (as Harbor reports)
- **repos** — count when available
- **base URL** — product host only; no credentials

## Out of scope

- Artifact/tag/scan detail → `harbor-artifacts`
- Retention purge / robot create / project delete → `harbor-safety`
- Other OCI registries

## Related (this plugin)

- `harbor-artifacts` — repositories, artifacts, tags, scans
- `harbor-safety` — delete / retention / robot / member gates
